    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322070/extras/4234e41b34b3f1b4f8c77c2207a3b53b.avif?t=1749355776\" data-has-big /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>A one-button rhythm mini-game anthology!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring diverse art styles and a wide variety of Brazilian musical genres, hit every note and become a <strong>RhythMaster</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322070/extras/64a901e9997e3e7c4f183a6b5b5008b7.poster.avif?t=1749355776\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322070/extras/64a901e9997e3e7c4f183a6b5b5008b7.webm?t=1749355776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322070/extras/64a901e9997e3e7c4f183a6b5b5008b7.mp4?t=1749355776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RhythMania uses a one-button mechanic inspired by classic console rhythm games, creating an experience that is quick to start and easy to play for both new players and longtime fans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With original music ranging from bossa nova to samba, ax\u00e9, pagode, and funk, and visuals by award-winning Brazilian artists, every mini-game brings a fresh burst of rhythm and color!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322070/extras/a6265cf035745bb52d116d5c24097d28.poster.avif?t=1749355776\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322070/extras/a6265cf035745bb52d116d5c24097d28.webm?t=1749355776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322070/extras/a6265cf035745bb52d116d5c24097d28.mp4?t=1749355776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322070/extras/c30d3ec6229998be7eb1d51531ebd4ab.avif?t=1749355776\" data-has-big /></span><br><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instant gameplay: </strong>Launch and start playing in seconds. Perfect for short bursts or longer sessions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens of mini-games: </strong>Master the rhythm across a wide range of themes \u2013 from flying kites to replying to lively group chats, loading moving trucks, rescuing stuck balls at the school gym, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supermixes</strong>: Push your skills with mashups that combine multiple stages into more demanding rhythm challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible controls: </strong>Play with keyboard, mouse, or your favorite controller.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements: </strong>Unlock goals by clearing stages, setting new records, and taking on extra challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Press, play, and master the beat in RhythMania!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322070/extras/415387e95afab2c0bd81dcc180abf649.avif?t=1749355776\" data-has-big /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322070/extras/89e4c56ce9fb577933e79fd1921c73ba.poster.avif?t=1749355776\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322070/extras/89e4c56ce9fb577933e79fd1921c73ba.webm?t=1749355776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322070/extras/89e4c56ce9fb577933e79fd1921c73ba.mp4?t=1749355776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322070/extras/4234e41b34b3f1b4f8c77c2207a3b53b.avif?t=1749355776\" data-has-big /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>A one-button rhythm mini-game anthology!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring diverse art styles and a wide variety of Brazilian musical genres, hit every note and become a <strong>RhythMaster</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322070/extras/64a901e9997e3e7c4f183a6b5b5008b7.poster.avif?t=1749355776\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322070/extras/64a901e9997e3e7c4f183a6b5b5008b7.webm?t=1749355776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322070/extras/64a901e9997e3e7c4f183a6b5b5008b7.mp4?t=1749355776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RhythMania uses a one-button mechanic inspired by classic console rhythm games, creating an experience that is quick to start and easy to play for both new players and longtime fans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With original music ranging from bossa nova to samba, ax\u00e9, pagode, and funk, and visuals by award-winning Brazilian artists, every mini-game brings a fresh burst of rhythm and color!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322070/extras/a6265cf035745bb52d116d5c24097d28.poster.avif?t=1749355776\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322070/extras/a6265cf035745bb52d116d5c24097d28.webm?t=1749355776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322070/extras/a6265cf035745bb52d116d5c24097d28.mp4?t=1749355776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322070/extras/c30d3ec6229998be7eb1d51531ebd4ab.avif?t=1749355776\" data-has-big /></span><br><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instant gameplay: </strong>Launch and start playing in seconds. Perfect for short bursts or longer sessions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens of mini-games: </strong>Master the rhythm across a wide range of themes \u2013 from flying kites to replying to lively group chats, loading moving trucks, rescuing stuck balls at the school gym, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supermixes</strong>: Push your skills with mashups that combine multiple stages into more demanding rhythm challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible controls: </strong>Play with keyboard, mouse, or your favorite controller.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements: </strong>Unlock goals by clearing stages, setting new records, and taking on extra challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Press, play, and master the beat in RhythMania!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322070/extras/415387e95afab2c0bd81dcc180abf649.avif?t=1749355776\" data-has-big /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322070/extras/89e4c56ce9fb577933e79fd1921c73ba.poster.avif?t=1749355776\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322070/extras/89e4c56ce9fb577933e79fd1921c73ba.webm?t=1749355776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322070/extras/89e4c56ce9fb577933e79fd1921c73ba.mp4?t=1749355776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
